WEBVTT

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:58.740
What's wrong?

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.740
What happened?

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:10.090
Boss!

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:12.710
What?

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.010
Dammit, where is he?

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:03.100
The results checked out. Nice work, Golgo 13.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:11.900
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:16.030
wondering what I should do right now.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:22.490
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:27.040
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:32.670
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:38.090
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:42.550
So faraway - let's run!

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:48.850
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:53.150
Oh someday - one of these days

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:58.240
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:04.330
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:09.910
depend on me for your repairs.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.290
So faraway - let's run!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:20.510
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:24.800
Oh someday - one of these days

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:30.850
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:41.990
Love is a Knife

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:47.540
Golgo 13, here's the rest we promised you.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.040
Tally it up, Natalie.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.300
Are you really Golgo 13?

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.890
Uh, I mean I never heard of Golgo 13 having an assistant.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:09.640
What I use for the jobs I take on is of no business to my clients.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:12.890
Or do you got a problem with the way I handle things?

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.520
No, that wasn't what I...

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.900
You wanna check out if I'm the real deal or not?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.150
N-No, absolutely not!

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:24.780
It's all here.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:25.820
Drive.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:06.450
Let's go to Florida... no, Southeast Asia!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:10.620
Let's go somewhere where nobody knows who we are.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:19.250
Ben, $2 million! We've earned $2 million dollars!

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.290
Yeah...

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:23.970
What's wrong? Aren't you glad?

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:28.970
Back when we first met after you ran away from that traveling circus

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:32.850
you were just a low-level gangster taking hit jobs for a $1,000.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:38.980
Now look at you, you went from earning $500,000 to $2 million in just one job!

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:46.990
Only because I stole the identity of that Golgo 13 guy you clued me onto, <i>and</i>  you found me that job.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.160
Golgo 13.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:55.040
I think it's about time the fake Golgo called it quits.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.500
Before the real one finds out.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.630
I'll keep working!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.460
Not as the fake Golgo, but as my own man!

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.590
What are you saying?

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:10.600
Your client trusted you only because you used Golgo 13's name!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:15.020
Just his name alone gets me $500,000.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:17.520
I'm done with being a fake!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.150
I'll become a top professional using what I got!

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:26.530
I'll blank out Golgo's name and write the name of Ben Pierce over it!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.450
Blank out Golgo's name?

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:30.530
Honey, don't tell me...

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:36.040
I can do the impossible if you're there to help me!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:41.040
Ben, you have no clue what kind of man Golgo 13 is.

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.710
How truly frightening he is...

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:29.260
<i>For a split second, I smelled gunpowder.</i>

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.390
<i>I knew then that man was Golgo 13.</i>

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:06.590
<i>Golgo 13 killed a bunch of very capable bodyguards who couldn't do a thing.</i>

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:18.470
<i>And he was killed for being slow on the draw, even though he himself was a quick shot.</i>

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:35.240
I hated him for killing the man I loved.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:38.620
So I plotted a revenge that I could carry out.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:46.250
I had a swaggering young man take on Golgo 13's name and swipe the money meant for him.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:52.720
But now I'm in love with that swaggering young man!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:53.760
Please.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.760
Don't think about killing Golgo 13.

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.680
Even at that, I still...

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:04.100
Look, calm down and think this through.

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:07.230
You don't know anything about real professionals.

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:11.150
Plus, Golgo is a man that has a body like steel.

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:12.190
So do I!

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.990
That's not all.

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:20.120
The man has a will like the Rock of Gibraltar, and he has mastered the art of pin-point shooting.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.700
Ben, do you have those too?

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:23.790
I can...

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:29.210
I can take down anyone without a sound from any place using only my knife!

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.920
It's better than any silencer.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:38.220
So that means I got an upper hand on him... on Golgo 13!

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:41.890
Natalie, help me become my own man!

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:43.720
Natalie!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.070
There's no stopping you, is there?

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.780
So we're doing this together... Natalie!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.660
This is for you... Natalie...

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.250
I'm going to kill Golgo for you!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:37.150
That's Warren Cole's pride and joy, the <i>El Castillo</i>.

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.870
It can even outrun FBI patrol boats.

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:47.290
Golgo 13 is going to be on that ship, right?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:51.290
Golgo took on a job to eliminate Warren Cole.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.800
That info is solid, I almost went crazy tracking it down.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.800
So there's no mistake.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:57.970
All right.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:07.980
<i>Warren Cole...</i>

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:12.980
<i>He's a big shot in the financial world...
plus he's well known in the underworld.</i>

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:20.530
<i>Cole is throwing this party to show how powerful he is.</i>

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.830
<i>He doesn't even know Golgo is after him.</i>

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:39.720
You're hired. I'll be looking forward to the show.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.340
Thank you very much.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:12:01.740
Relinquish all guns and other weapons to us
and you will get them back upon your return.

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:11.710
We ask for your cooperation with this security measure so you can all enjoy a pleasant experience on the <i>El Castillo</i>.

00:12:23.550 --> 00:12:25.300
Okay, thank you.

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:46.870
So here comes the stinking rich.

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:51.790
It's him.

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.210
That's Golgo 13!

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:36.080
Ben, where are you going?

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:38.250
For a little meet and greet.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.590
Let me help.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.550
Thanks a lot.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.530
I'm sorry.

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:12.700
Are you hurt?

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.500
I'm okay.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:48.990
Pssht! Make me eat here, will they?

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.620
This takes me back to the circus!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:55.740
Why did you pull that stunt?

00:14:57.620 --> 00:15:01.420
This may be me just being overanxious, but...

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:06.300
...<i>the</i>  Golgo 13 didn't even try to avoid those falling luggage.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.010
Nope.

00:15:09.930 --> 00:15:13.890
The guy's an overprecise machine just like you said he is.

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:21.230
During that instant, he checked out his entire surroundings and made the best choice.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:28.650
If he tried to avoid them, they would have broken the glass.

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.740
That then would have gotten the attention of the guards.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:35.410
He was trying to avoid too much scrutiny.

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:37.580
So that's why he helped with the luggage.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:42.250
He also checked to see if I was carrying a weapon.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:53.010
He left without anyone noticing or being the center of attention.

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.970
So that he can carry out his job no doubt.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:58.060
That man is fearsome.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:07.230
Stupid moth.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.440
Yeah.

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.780
Were you found out?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:21.910
He doesn't know. He thinks I was just some blundering ship personnel.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.610
We'll be slaving through the whole night.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.280
Quit whining, it's just work.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.450
Huh... what?

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.580
Do you know where my sax is?

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:00.790
Nope.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:16.840
Ladies and gentleman, allow me to express my undying gratitude with this good food and vintage wine.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.350
We also have a fun show for you all.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.310
Enjoy this night to the fullest!

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.210
Is he here?

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.710
No he's not.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.420
He'll be here.

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.460
The show is his only chance to get at Cole.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.090
But before he does...

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:58.220
...this knife will pin his neck to the wall!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:27.830
Excellent!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.000
Splendid!

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:30.630
Spectacular!

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.190
Excellent!

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:54.110
Bravo!

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.880
Hey, show us more!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:12.750
He's here.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:15.050
Yeah, right on schedule.

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:20.010
During the next show, only the stage
will be illuminated. That's your chance.

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.140
Yeah, I know.

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:43.220
<i>Now!</i>

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.310
Impossible! He deflected it!

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.480
That can't be!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:03.070
Ben!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:27.930
What the heck's going on!

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.770
What happened?

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:38.940
What's going on?!

00:21:43.990 --> 00:21:45.200
Get the lights, hurry!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:47.410
Can't, they're not working!

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:48.870
Where's the power?

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:01.960
I knew all along... this would happen.

00:22:40.670 --> 00:22:45.800
I enjoyed the little things.

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:53.010
I loved when you gave me a flower every day

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:59.100
instead of just one big bouquet

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:03.940
of flowers.

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:11.570
It was like a romance novel.

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:16.160
Surely someday... just kidding.

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:19.540
I had a dream.

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:25.250
Your face shined eternally.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:31.840
Because I think of you all the time.

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:37.390
I'm sorry, but on a lonely night like this

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:43.900
I'm remembering you, but

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:48.490
I won't cry like I did that day.

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:51.660
I won't.

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:06.960
On a rough and stormy sea, a large ship loaded with oil got hijacked.

00:24:07.840 --> 00:24:11.680
Over 20 crew members were taken hostage.

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:18.010
Golgo, tasked to kill the offenders, uses an underwater vessel

00:24:17.680 --> 00:24:20.390
to come out from the ocean to get a drop on his targets.

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:23.900
Next time on Golgo 13: Angry Waves.

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:28.570
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
